{
  "id": "dashboard-cache-key-freeform",
  "title": "Cached dashboard route: code, numbered steps and a legend",
  "persona": "A product engineer looking into reports that users who switch organisations see the old organisation's dashboard numbers, sketching the route handler and its cache from memory.",
  "topic": "why the dashboard shows the wrong org's numbers after switching org",
  "realism": "When the suspect is one line of code, people write the snippet on the board and draw an arrow at the line; execution order goes into numbered circles next to a rough architecture sketch, emphasis is a pen underline, and colours get a small legend in a corner because the colours carry the argument.",
